%%% note
MCP サーバーの mcp:on-new-session-listener (rejection)、default-response-headers、session-handling (sessionIdleTimeout、sessionsObjectStore)。
on-new-session-listener のフローは initialize のたびに走る。成功の後に rejection の rejectWithStatusCode が null でなければ、その状態・本文 (rejectWithMessage、無ければ null)・ヘッダで拒否してセッションを開かない。失敗は 500 (本文は例外の型と説明)。
セッション ID は揺れるので capture で次の request へ渡し、応答の記録からは mask で伏せる。
%%% port 18212
%%% mask
[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}
%%% capture SID header:mcp-session-id
%%% request POST /a headers=*
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"t","version":"1"}}}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json
mcp-session-id: ***
mcp-protocol-version: 2025-06-18

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"experimental":{},"logging":{},"prompts":{"listChanged":false},"resources":{"subscribe":false,"listChanged":false},"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"serverInfo":{"name":"A","version":"1.0.0"}}}
%%% request POST /a headers=*
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: {{SID}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"hello","arguments":{}}}
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json
mcp-protocol-version: 2025-06-18

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"hi"}],"isError":false}}
%%% request POST /a headers=*
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
X-Deny: yes

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"t","version":"1"}}}
%%% response 403
x-code: 403

no entry
